  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a07c4eea-9246-c94f-92cd-ece2b282e3f6"],
 " subdivisions on its shortest polygon side. Each loop omits the repeated \
closing vertex."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1536416833,ExpressionUUID->"ff63a071-cabc-f744-9352-2f7382a6bbff"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The returned list of loops can be used for ",
